WEBVTT

00:02.980 --> 00:04.720
Huh? Did I oversleep?

00:04.720 --> 00:05.730
Master Cain!

00:06.040 --> 00:09.940
I was late in waking you on the big day 
of your academy entrance exams!

00:09.940 --> 00:12.290
Yeah, but there's still plenty of time—

00:12.290 --> 00:15.160
Please eat your breakfast right away!

00:15.160 --> 00:18.280
I'm sorry I was so underprepared!

00:18.280 --> 00:22.140
If you end up late because of me, 
I'll regret it forever!

00:23.270 --> 00:25.870
Seriously, Sylvia, it's fine. 
I won't be late.

00:25.870 --> 00:27.250
Okay, I'll be going now.

00:27.720 --> 00:29.960
Take care, Master Cain!

00:29.960 --> 00:31.590
Good luck on your exams!

00:35.230 --> 00:37.050
I knew I'd make it in time.

00:37.850 --> 00:40.540
<i>I'm a reincarnated noble with 
off-the-charts abilities</i>

00:40.540 --> 00:42.570
<i>that let me instantly go 
anywhere I've already been.</i>

00:42.570 --> 00:48.330
<i>But since this is the big day of my entrance 
exams, I ended up using those abilities.</i>

00:48.330 --> 00:51.690
<i>Of course, this is a secret to everyone!</i>

01:02.200 --> 01:05.080
The Aristocrat's
<b>Otherworldly Adventure:
Serving Gods Who Go Too Far</b>

02:22.510 --> 02:26.770
"The Royal Academy"

02:22.510 --> 02:26.770
"The Royal Academy"

02:24.820 --> 02:26.450
Your name, please?

02:26.450 --> 02:27.990
Sure. It's Cain.

02:28.310 --> 02:32.190
All right, your exam number is 285.

02:32.190 --> 02:34.800
Please take seat number 10 in classroom A.

02:34.800 --> 02:36.550
Thank you.

02:36.550 --> 02:39.520
<i>Huh... There's no one I know on this list.</i>

02:39.520 --> 02:42.760
<i>I wonder why. Even the kids I met 
at the debut party aren't here.</i>

02:47.990 --> 02:50.810
<i>Maybe Teles and Silk are in a different room.</i>

02:54.090 --> 02:56.180
The entrance exams will now begin.

02:56.520 --> 03:01.200
Anyone found cheating will be 
immediately ejected from the premises.

03:01.450 --> 03:04.070
You have two hours. Now...

03:04.410 --> 03:05.080
Begin!

03:06.840 --> 03:07.970
<i>Lucky me!</i>

03:07.970 --> 03:10.730
<i>Reading, writing, and arithmetic 
will be easy with my knowledge</i>

03:10.730 --> 03:11.440
<i>from my previous life,</i>

03:11.440 --> 03:14.750
<i>and the history questions are 
all things any noble would know!</i>

03:21.970 --> 03:25.530
You there. Are you sure 
you can afford to relax?

03:25.530 --> 03:27.390
It's only been thirty minutes.

03:28.570 --> 03:30.060
Oh, I'm fine.

03:30.460 --> 03:32.520
I've already finished the whole thing.

03:32.990 --> 03:33.750
Already?

03:36.840 --> 03:38.030
And stop.

03:39.150 --> 03:42.330
Everyone, pens down. Leave your 
answer sheets where they are.

03:42.770 --> 03:46.160
This class will now proceed 
to magic ability assessment.

03:46.160 --> 03:48.150
Ooh! Magic?!

03:50.440 --> 03:51.580
Now, all of you,

03:51.580 --> 03:56.500
choose a target and direct 
your strongest spell at it.

03:56.500 --> 03:59.460
Excuse me. Can we use our full power?

04:00.460 --> 04:04.810
Yes. There is a defensive barrier 
around this training area,

04:04.810 --> 04:07.430
so it safe to any level of magic you can.

04:08.470 --> 04:09.390
And begin!

04:09.910 --> 04:10.890
Here I go!

04:10.890 --> 04:14.210
Appear here now, reveal in 
darkness, amplify the light...

04:14.210 --> 04:15.660
Fire Ball!

04:22.400 --> 04:26.310
<i>Oh, yeah. That's about how powerful 
most twelve-year-olds are.</i>

04:26.310 --> 04:30.710
<i>Since she said we can use full power, 
I thought about using Inferno...</i>

04:31.030 --> 04:32.620
<i>That'd be dangerous, though.</i>

04:32.620 --> 04:34.340
Number 285!

04:34.340 --> 04:36.340
Begin your incantation, please.

04:36.340 --> 04:37.080
Right.

04:40.880 --> 04:42.090
What is that?!

04:43.120 --> 04:44.490
W-Wait!

04:44.490 --> 04:46.680
Fire Bullet!

04:57.440 --> 05:00.900
You said it'd be safe to use any 
beginner-level spell at full power

05:00.900 --> 05:03.190
since there's a barrier...

05:03.190 --> 05:04.610
What just happened?!

05:04.610 --> 05:07.880
I-I used Fire Bullet.

05:07.880 --> 05:09.080
Impossible!

05:09.080 --> 05:12.150
No beginner-level spell is this powerful!

05:12.720 --> 05:16.220
We need to make sure there 
was no one beyond that wall!

05:17.610 --> 05:21.500
This area is no longer usable! 
Proceed to the swordsmanship exam!

05:23.710 --> 05:26.050
Sorry about that.

05:27.110 --> 05:30.350
The swordsmanship exam will now begin.

05:30.810 --> 05:34.480
As special guests today, 
the adventurers' guild has sent

05:34.760 --> 05:38.210
these A-rank adventurers 
to lend you their support.

05:38.210 --> 05:39.810
Hey! It's Claude!

05:39.810 --> 05:42.020
What? Cain, what are you doing here?

05:43.070 --> 05:45.360
I'm twelve now, so I'm
 taking the entrance exams.

05:45.360 --> 05:48.110
Ah. I'll be your opponent, then.

05:48.110 --> 05:50.070
Uh, no, that's quite all right...

05:50.070 --> 05:51.280
Why not?!

05:51.560 --> 05:56.690
Are you refusing an invitation 
to train with Claude,

05:56.690 --> 05:58.170
the highest-ranked examiner here?

05:58.170 --> 05:59.670
Uh, no, I just...

05:59.670 --> 06:03.280
Claude has chosen you, 
so you will train under him.

06:05.990 --> 06:09.220
In that case, Claude, I look 
forward to learning from you.

06:09.450 --> 06:12.300
Sure, Cain. I'll assess 
what your skill level is,

06:12.300 --> 06:14.350
so come at me with all you've got!

06:14.350 --> 06:17.680
<i>Since he's A-rank, 
he's clearly pretty skilled.</i>

06:17.910 --> 06:19.270
<i>Boost!</i>

06:20.420 --> 06:22.250
You can even use Boost?

06:22.250 --> 06:25.140
Looks like I'm gonna get 
to have some real fun here!

06:26.360 --> 06:27.370
S-So fast...

06:27.370 --> 06:28.700
I can't even see what's going on!

06:28.700 --> 06:31.310
Wow, Cain! You're strong!

06:31.310 --> 06:33.740
Stronger than any of the examiners here!

06:33.740 --> 06:37.500
Claude, this is an exam! 
Please don't put so much force into it!

06:38.490 --> 06:40.330
This is starting to get fun!

06:40.330 --> 06:42.290
I'll also use... Boost!

06:44.010 --> 06:46.230
This is why I just can't quit battling!

06:46.650 --> 06:48.590
<i>Not that it's a problem since 
it's me fighting him, but...</i>

06:49.840 --> 06:51.050
Claude!

06:51.050 --> 06:54.510
You'd break any of these other 
kids' bones with one hit!

06:54.510 --> 06:56.850
All right! That is quite enough!

06:58.090 --> 07:01.800
What do you think you're doing?! 
Having a mock battle of that intensity

07:01.800 --> 07:04.150
is making our other students 
wither on the spot!

07:05.880 --> 07:07.930
Oops, did we take it a little too far?

07:07.930 --> 07:10.570
Oh, well. Cain, that's it for today.

07:11.250 --> 07:13.450
But let's accept a quest together sometime.

07:13.450 --> 07:15.030
And then we'll... Okay?

07:16.260 --> 07:18.000
I'd rather decline, if that's an option...

07:18.490 --> 07:19.330
Aw, why?

07:19.690 --> 07:21.060
That's enough!

07:21.060 --> 07:24.340
I've seen your skill, so this exam is over!

07:24.340 --> 07:24.790
Huh?!

07:24.790 --> 07:28.760
You can go home now. Come back on 
the day we announce who passed.

07:29.400 --> 07:31.330
I'm sorry.

07:35.850 --> 07:36.890
I'm home.

07:37.130 --> 07:40.970
Welcome home, Master Cain! 
How were the exams?

07:40.970 --> 07:43.480
No problem. I finished them all just fine.

07:43.750 --> 07:46.170
I did everything right, 
so I should make it in.

07:46.170 --> 07:47.750
I thought so!

07:47.750 --> 07:51.850
In that case, we'll have a party 
today to celebrate your acceptance!

07:51.850 --> 07:53.590
It's too soon for that.

07:53.590 --> 07:56.580
Not at all! I want to apologize 
for my failure this morning, too!

07:56.580 --> 07:58.910
Seriously, it's all right—

07:57.970 --> 07:58.680
<b>Gurgle</b>

08:00.720 --> 08:03.120
See? You're a growing 
boy with a big appetite!

08:03.120 --> 08:05.170
I'll cook enough to feed ten tonight!

08:05.420 --> 08:07.540
I'll start preparing right away!

08:07.540 --> 08:10.730
Sylvia, I can't eat <i>that</i> much!

08:11.410 --> 08:12.540
<i>Although...</i>

08:23.820 --> 08:25.230
What is the meaning of this?

08:25.560 --> 08:30.310
Well, the examiner told me to 
use my magic at full power.

08:30.310 --> 08:33.570
She said it would be fine since 
there was a barrier set up...

08:33.910 --> 08:36.820
I knew I probably shouldn't use 
intermediate or emperor-level magic,

08:36.820 --> 08:39.010
so I only used beginner-level...

08:39.010 --> 08:41.510
but I destroyed the barrier 
along with the target.

08:42.000 --> 08:44.580
You can use emperor-level magic?

08:44.950 --> 08:48.790
Yes, but I can't predict what may 
happen to my surroundings if I do.

08:49.060 --> 08:50.550
Could I try it out somewhere?

08:50.550 --> 08:52.380
Absolutely not!

08:52.700 --> 08:54.850
That... wasn't just an act, was it?

08:54.850 --> 08:58.040
Of course not! You should know 
that's out of the question.

08:58.040 --> 09:01.090
Pardon me. I'll try to be 
more prudent in the future.

09:01.090 --> 09:02.740
Incidentally, Cain...

09:03.630 --> 09:05.690
Where did you take these exams?

09:06.190 --> 09:10.650
Both Telestia and Silk said they 
didn't see you at the exam site.

09:10.650 --> 09:12.970
Huh? Well...

09:12.970 --> 09:15.300
I checked in at the south entrance,

09:15.300 --> 09:18.030
and I took the exam in the 
room they directed me to.

09:18.550 --> 09:21.810
Cain, you do know why the 
academy has a north entrance

09:21.810 --> 09:23.730
and a south entrance, don't you?

09:23.730 --> 09:27.440
Yes. The north entrance leads 
to where the nobles live,

09:27.440 --> 09:30.380
and the south entrance leads 
to where the commoners live.

09:30.730 --> 09:33.590
And which entrance did you use again?

09:33.830 --> 09:35.460
Of course, the south...

09:36.960 --> 09:40.780
Exactly. There was a receptionist 
at the north entrance for nobles.

09:40.780 --> 09:43.630
And the exams are conducted 
in completely different areas!

09:43.630 --> 09:47.080
You took your exams with 
the commoner children.

09:47.080 --> 09:50.320
Telestia was furious that 
she didn't get to see you!

09:50.320 --> 09:54.330
And the headmaster of the 
academy came to talk to me.

09:54.130 --> 09:56.240
<b>Let's Go Back in Time</b>

09:56.770 --> 10:00.950
You see, we had a bit of a problem 
with this year's entrance exams.

10:00.950 --> 10:04.800
What's the problem? Can't you just 
announce the results as usual?

10:04.800 --> 10:06.690
This happens every year.

10:06.690 --> 10:11.160
The thing is, a commoner child got 
a perfect score on the written exam.

10:11.160 --> 10:14.050
That same child destroyed 
the training area,

10:14.050 --> 10:17.860
and fought on equal footing 
with an A-rank adventurer.

10:19.040 --> 10:22.530
Duke Eric! This is no laughing matter!

10:24.560 --> 10:26.960
I bet that child's name was Cain, wasn't it?

10:26.960 --> 10:27.730
Yes...

10:27.960 --> 10:31.430
But why do you know that, Duke Eric?

10:31.960 --> 10:33.320
Oh, my stomach...

10:33.750 --> 10:35.690
Of course it was Cain.

10:35.690 --> 10:38.510
Even more reason you should 
just let the results stand.

10:38.510 --> 10:39.730
Huh?

10:39.730 --> 10:42.970
Sounds like Cain sure put 
on quite a show, though.

10:42.970 --> 10:48.350
I bet Prime Minister Magna will be shocked 
when he sees the repair bill later.

10:50.310 --> 10:52.010
And with that said...

10:52.010 --> 10:54.840
I have the repair bill right here.

10:55.500 --> 11:00.130
How many times have I warned 
you not to overdo it?!

11:00.640 --> 11:02.320
I'm sorry.

11:02.320 --> 11:05.340
Well, no matter. 
The results will be announced today.

11:05.340 --> 11:07.510
Go and see them for yourself.

11:08.190 --> 11:09.430
Okay.

11:11.710 --> 11:13.730
285...

11:13.960 --> 11:16.120
285...

11:16.120 --> 11:18.190
Oh, there you are!

11:18.810 --> 11:22.000
Congratulations, Cain! You're top of the class.

11:22.000 --> 11:25.280
Teles is second, and I'm third. See?

11:26.700 --> 11:28.770
Father told me, you know.

11:28.770 --> 11:32.540
You checked in at the south entrance 
and tested with the commoners, huh?

11:32.540 --> 11:34.910
And you destroyed the training area!

11:35.810 --> 11:37.500
That was a big "oops," all right.

11:38.070 --> 11:40.370
And Teles isn't here today,

11:40.370 --> 11:43.550
but she was angry because she 
didn't get to see you on exam day.

11:43.550 --> 11:44.490
Huh?!

11:45.540 --> 11:47.310
I'm gonna get chewed out again...

11:47.640 --> 11:51.350
Well, look forward to 
seeing me in my uniform!

11:51.610 --> 11:54.810
If I don't see you at the entrance ceremony, 
I'll make you sit on your heels!

11:55.270 --> 11:56.230
Huh?!

11:59.610 --> 12:01.630
Right this way!

12:01.630 --> 12:05.530
Everyone who passed, 
check in at reception on this side.

12:06.140 --> 12:07.650
It's Sister Reine!

12:07.650 --> 12:10.060
Sister Reine! Long time no see!

12:10.410 --> 12:11.730
Cain!

12:11.730 --> 12:14.210
Cain! Cain! Cain!

12:14.600 --> 12:18.370
It's been so long! You haven't 
been to our mansion in ages!

12:18.370 --> 12:19.510
Sorry...

12:19.510 --> 12:20.400
Good for you!

12:20.400 --> 12:20.910
Huh?

12:20.910 --> 12:24.240
You passed with flying colors! 
And top of the class, no less!

12:24.240 --> 12:26.010
That's my Cain!

12:26.010 --> 12:28.230
Good luck with your speech 
at the entrance ceremony!

12:28.230 --> 12:29.410
Speech?!

12:29.410 --> 12:31.050
Yes! Didn't you know?

12:31.050 --> 12:33.370
Every year, the top-scoring 
student gives a speech.

12:33.370 --> 12:35.490
What?! Really?!

12:35.490 --> 12:37.370
I'd rather have Teles do it...

12:37.370 --> 12:40.160
You can't! It's already been announced!

12:40.160 --> 12:41.260
Good luck!

12:42.610 --> 12:44.690
Fidget, fidget...

12:44.690 --> 12:46.860
Fidget, fidget...

12:46.860 --> 12:49.280
Fidget, fidget...

12:48.070 --> 12:49.280
I'm home.

12:49.280 --> 12:49.950
Fidget...

12:49.950 --> 12:51.550
How did it go?!

12:51.550 --> 12:53.370
I passed at the top of the class.

12:56.090 --> 12:59.290
I'm so glad! I'm so glad! I'm so glad!

12:59.290 --> 13:02.320
Remarkable, Master Cain. 
How surprising that you scored the highest.

13:02.320 --> 13:05.320
No, I had faith that Master Cain could do it!

13:05.320 --> 13:06.400
Thanks.

13:06.400 --> 13:08.060
We must celebrate tonight!

13:08.060 --> 13:09.870
I'll cook enough to feed a hundred!

13:09.870 --> 13:11.350
I'll start preparing right away!

13:11.760 --> 13:13.070
Look forward to it!

13:13.070 --> 13:17.110
If I eat that much, 
it'll be my stomach that fails.

13:17.110 --> 13:18.480
She's happy, that's all.

13:18.840 --> 13:21.300
I know. She's just on 
the wrong scale with it.

13:21.300 --> 13:22.690
But an occasion like this...

13:23.470 --> 13:24.880
is reason to be happy.

13:25.260 --> 13:26.660
<b>And Then</b>

13:27.400 --> 13:29.050
This is the south entrance,

13:29.050 --> 13:30.610
and this one's north!

13:32.660 --> 13:35.250
Father and Mother came to see me!

13:36.510 --> 13:38.080
Master Cain!

13:38.080 --> 13:40.040
Good morning, Master Cain.

13:40.350 --> 13:42.500
Teles, Silk. Good morning.

13:43.740 --> 13:45.470
I look forward to studying together.

13:45.470 --> 13:46.650
Yes...

13:46.650 --> 13:48.680
Cain, that uniform suits you too well.

13:49.040 --> 13:50.640
You two look great, too.

13:57.480 --> 13:58.960
Who the heck is he?

13:58.960 --> 14:01.090
Isn't that Princess Telestia?

14:01.090 --> 14:03.830
And Duke Santana's daughter, too.

14:03.830 --> 14:06.530
How dare he get friendly with them!

14:06.530 --> 14:10.170
The boy in the middle is so dreamy, though!

14:11.160 --> 14:16.870
We will now commence the 
Royal Academy entrance ceremony.

14:17.180 --> 14:20.960
First, representing the new 
students, Cain von Silford.

14:22.010 --> 14:22.670
Yes, sir.

14:28.100 --> 14:31.450
Pleased to meet you all. 
I'm Cain von Silford.

14:31.450 --> 14:36.100
On the day of the exams, I mixed 
up the north and south entrances,

14:36.100 --> 14:39.440
and took the exams separately 
from the rest of you.

14:41.790 --> 14:46.360
But I'm grateful to this very 
generous academy for forgiving me

14:46.360 --> 14:49.280
and treating me the same 
as the other students.

14:49.860 --> 14:51.490
Just as the first king said that

14:51.490 --> 14:55.170
all people of this kingdom share 
an equal right to be educated,

14:55.170 --> 14:59.040
I plan to make friends at this academy

14:59.040 --> 15:02.500
without regard for my 
bloodline or anyone else's.

15:02.770 --> 15:05.370
I'm sure I'll be depending 
on you all for a lot.

15:05.370 --> 15:07.710
I pray we'll all get along well.

15:12.030 --> 15:14.710
Now, this is very short notice,

15:14.710 --> 15:16.740
but His Majesty the King is present,

15:16.740 --> 15:18.840
so we'd like a few words from him.

15:18.840 --> 15:19.350
Huh?

15:19.350 --> 15:21.530
Father is here?

15:23.310 --> 15:24.400
<i>Why?!</i>

15:24.830 --> 15:27.300
Everyone, congratulations 
on entering the academy.

15:27.300 --> 15:30.880
I know there are <i>some</i> new students 
this year who are quite irregular,

15:30.880 --> 15:33.470
so I have come to speak in person.

15:33.470 --> 15:36.030
I'm sure it will be a 
challenge for you teachers,

15:36.030 --> 15:37.990
but I hope you'll all do your best!

15:38.320 --> 15:40.960
<i>Why do I feel like I'm being warned?!</i>

15:42.410 --> 15:45.400
"Irregular," he says! I like that!

15:46.120 --> 15:47.670
Simple though it may be,

15:47.670 --> 15:49.130
it is my sincerest hope that

15:49.130 --> 15:52.800
all new students will display 
vast growth and effort here.

15:52.800 --> 15:56.050
Thus I welcome and congratulate all of you.

15:58.410 --> 16:01.210
Now, the rest is up to you!

16:03.650 --> 16:05.420
Cain! Cain!

16:05.420 --> 16:06.970
You're late!

16:06.970 --> 16:08.290
Over here!

16:08.290 --> 16:09.850
What happened?

16:09.850 --> 16:13.410
The king kept telling me 
over and over to be careful.

16:14.920 --> 16:16.570
All right, take your seats.

16:17.660 --> 16:20.440
Starting today, I'll be 
your homeroom teacher.

16:20.440 --> 16:22.510
My name is Elka von Portlay.

16:22.510 --> 16:26.330
Before starting classes, you will all 
need to choose your course of study.

16:26.330 --> 16:29.420
Please think carefully 
about your future path.

16:30.270 --> 16:32.190
I gotta go for adventuring!

16:32.190 --> 16:33.380
You can't!

16:33.660 --> 16:37.330
You're already a land-owning noble, you know.

16:37.330 --> 16:40.960
You'll need to learn all kinds 
of things about nobility.

16:40.960 --> 16:43.500
Make sure you choose the nobility course!

16:44.610 --> 16:46.450
Don't sulk, Cain.

16:46.450 --> 16:49.780
You can just choose adventuring 
along with nobility.

16:49.780 --> 16:53.690
Oh, yeah! We're not limited 
to just one, right?

16:53.690 --> 16:54.740
Okay, I've decided!

16:54.740 --> 16:58.730
I'll go for nobility, adventuring, 
magic, and magic items!

16:58.730 --> 17:00.610
What are you two choosing?

17:01.080 --> 17:05.030
I think I'll choose nobility 
and internal affairs.

17:05.030 --> 17:06.820
Why internal affairs?

17:06.820 --> 17:08.780
Well, of course...

17:08.780 --> 17:12.290
so I can manage your future 
domain, Master Cain...

17:12.290 --> 17:13.380
I guess...

17:13.380 --> 17:16.770
I think I'll choose nobility and commerce.

17:16.770 --> 17:21.350
I want to study whatever will be 
of help to your future domain!

17:21.670 --> 17:22.310
Right?

17:22.310 --> 17:23.520
Right!

17:26.090 --> 17:27.610
Thanks, you two.

17:27.610 --> 17:30.360
I can't say much about managing a domain yet,

17:30.360 --> 17:31.940
but I'll work hard for both of you.

17:32.280 --> 17:35.740
Of course! I look forward to it, Cain!

17:32.280 --> 17:35.740
Of course! I look forward to it, Master Cain!

17:38.780 --> 17:40.120
Well, c'mon!

17:40.390 --> 17:41.930
What's the deal?

17:43.240 --> 17:44.830
Those cat ears...

17:45.370 --> 17:46.290
Parma!

17:46.290 --> 17:50.090
What is a beastfolk commoner 
like you doing in Class A?

17:50.090 --> 17:53.480
A duke's son such as myself is 
a much better fit for Class A!

17:53.480 --> 17:54.890
That's right!

17:54.890 --> 17:56.160
Go home right now!

17:56.160 --> 17:58.560
If you hadn't come to this academy,

17:58.560 --> 18:00.600
I would've been in Class A!

18:00.600 --> 18:02.590
Drop out of school right now!

18:02.590 --> 18:04.260
B-But...

18:04.260 --> 18:07.430
Why are you starting fights 
on our first day of school?

18:07.430 --> 18:10.610
Nobles and commoners are to be 
treated equally at this school.

18:11.060 --> 18:15.030
That has nothing to do with a 
noble as highly ranked as me—

18:15.030 --> 18:16.030
Y-You're...

18:16.330 --> 18:16.920
Ba...

18:16.920 --> 18:17.240
Ba...

18:17.240 --> 18:19.020
Baron Cain!

18:19.020 --> 18:20.070
What's going on?

18:20.480 --> 18:24.040
At this school, not even a high-ranked 
noble has the right to say that.

18:24.490 --> 18:25.750
Yet you're...

18:25.750 --> 18:28.830
On top of that, this girl is my friend.

18:29.180 --> 18:30.830
Your friend?!

18:31.110 --> 18:32.340
Yes.

18:32.350 --> 18:35.420
B-Baron Cain, you're a noble, too!

18:35.420 --> 18:38.510
Why are you siding with a commoner 
and not a fellow noble?!

18:38.510 --> 18:40.910
Noble or commoner makes no difference to me.

18:40.910 --> 18:42.790
I side with my friends.

18:42.790 --> 18:45.440
Hmph! If you're siding with 
a commoner over a duke's son,

18:45.440 --> 18:48.880
I'll just tell my father and get 
him to ruin her entire family!

18:48.880 --> 18:50.610
R-Ruin them?!

18:50.610 --> 18:52.560
What's this? What are you ruining, exactly?

18:54.400 --> 18:57.020
M-Miss Silk?!

18:57.020 --> 18:59.700
Might I ask what is going on here?

18:59.700 --> 19:03.870
P-Princess Telestia?!

19:04.870 --> 19:07.190
Nobles cannot exist without commoners,

19:07.190 --> 19:09.620
so what you just said is quite problematic.

19:09.620 --> 19:12.050
Do I need to report this to my father?

19:12.050 --> 19:15.570
N-No! What I said a moment ago was wrong!

19:15.570 --> 19:16.800
I'm very sorry!

19:16.800 --> 19:18.940
I'm not the one you should apologize to.

19:18.940 --> 19:23.450
Would you not agree that you need to 
apologize to the one you were harassing?

19:24.990 --> 19:28.610
I... I would like to tell 
you that I'm s-s-s-s...

19:28.610 --> 19:29.400
S...?

19:29.400 --> 19:33.910
S-S-Sorry!

19:35.520 --> 19:38.580
Parma, I'm sorry it took me 
so long to realize it was you.

19:38.580 --> 19:40.780
Not at all! Thank you so much!

19:41.010 --> 19:44.200
I'm so glad I'm attending 
the same school as you!

19:44.200 --> 19:46.990
It's a shame I couldn't make 
it into your class, though.

19:47.210 --> 19:50.470
No, Class A is plenty impressive.

19:50.470 --> 19:52.570
If there's anything you don't 
understand, just ask me.

19:52.570 --> 19:53.960
I'll be happy to help.

19:54.210 --> 19:56.510
Okay! I appreciate it!

19:57.060 --> 20:00.040
Excuse me, Master Cain. May I?

20:00.040 --> 20:02.680
You two seem awfully close.

20:02.680 --> 20:05.460
Perhaps we need to have a talk?

20:05.790 --> 20:08.410
Cain, you sit on your heels 
and wait right there.

20:08.410 --> 20:10.100
Huh? On my heels?

20:10.100 --> 20:13.310
Just do it! On! Your! Heels!

20:14.270 --> 20:15.020
Right...

20:18.880 --> 20:21.240
Might we have a little talk?

20:21.240 --> 20:21.740
Sure...

20:24.250 --> 20:26.800
<i>Just what is this secret meeting about?</i>

20:28.500 --> 20:32.600
<i>They're hitting it off. Is this the 
start of some weird new alliance?</i>

20:32.910 --> 20:35.980
<i>Also, how long do I have to sit like this?!</i>

20:37.120 --> 20:39.480
<i>You're an interesting kid, 
just like the old man said!</i>

20:39.480 --> 20:40.620
<i>I like you.</i>

20:41.760 --> 20:42.970
<i>Why don't we have a little chat?</i>

20:43.600 --> 20:44.180
Who's that?

20:44.640 --> 20:46.790
<i>Your legs are going numb, aren't they?</i>

20:46.790 --> 20:48.830
<i>I'm waiting in the library. Come see me.</i>

20:49.890 --> 20:52.810
<i>Well, come on, get in here. Let's talk.</i>

21:01.560 --> 21:02.780
Well, I'm here...

21:13.010 --> 21:14.370
Do you take sugar?

21:14.370 --> 21:16.080
Uh... yes...

21:16.330 --> 21:19.000
Wait, who <i>are</i> you?!

21:19.450 --> 21:22.740
And how is there coffee in this world?!

21:22.740 --> 21:26.860
I've been waiting for you to come 
here, Cain von Silford-kun...

21:27.170 --> 21:30.310
Also known as... Shiina Kazuya.

21:35.240 --> 21:37.460
Wh-What?

23:09.330 --> 23:11.280
Here you go. Coffee with sugar.

23:11.280 --> 23:12.840
You really are a child.

23:13.690 --> 23:14.800
Not going to drink it?

23:16.640 --> 23:19.500
Relax. It's not poisoned or anything.

23:23.260 --> 23:24.360
<i>This is good!</i>

23:24.360 --> 23:29.170
<i>I haven't had any in nine years, 
so it's off-the-charts good!</i>

23:34.950 --> 23:36.430
<b>Preview</b>

23:35.320 --> 23:36.790
Next time, "Training."

23:36.790 --> 23:39.890
I'm confident in my vocal training!

23:36.790 --> 23:40.250
<b>"Training"</b>
